**Issue**: #436
**Date**: 2026-09-25
**Status**: Approved
**Author**: NMG

Feature: Branch-first execute and full-green delivery

  @SCN001
  Scenario: Resume from the issue branch despite stale runtime files
    Given an issue branch with an approved spec and stale run and ledger files
    When execute runs
    Then it selects the branch issue and verifies or implements from live evidence

  @SCN002
  Scenario: Repair distinct failures without an attempt ceiling
    Given repeated distinct failed verifications
    When each repair changes the source
    Then execute reverifies the new head and continues until green

  @SCN003
  Scenario: Deliver only after full-green registered verification
    Given registered steering validations including smoke
    When delivery runs
    Then merge happens only at the exact passing head and the issue closes

  @SCN004
  Scenario: Bind smoke proof to the invocation
    Given a nested smoke delivery
    When its PR merges
    Then the pre-merge receipt carries the outer invocation id

  @SCN005
  Scenario: Cancel only owned panes
    Given a cancelled controller with foreign panes present
    When the supervisor cleans up
    Then only invocation-owned panes close
